title: "Before You Build: an evidence-first kit of AI skills for validating product ideas"
abstract: "An open-source method and seven AI agent skills that help founders and small teams without a product manager test product ideas against real-world evidence: mapping assumptions, designing the cheapest test with a pre-registered bar, grading evidence on a six-level ladder, and reaching CONTINUE, CHANGE or STOP decisions."
